 about: <br>-something that is happening now <br>-something that is happening around now (today)<br> <br>Form : <span class=\"strong\">subject + to be + verb+<u>ing</span></u>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Simple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It tastes so good!<br>We love coffee here.<br>The taste of coffee is unique in every country.<br> </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm drinking more coffee here in Brazil. <br>I'm enjoying this coffee. <br>This coffee I'm drinking is strong.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go to an English coffee shop's website."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the types of coffee drinks they offer."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose three that you want to try."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write two sentences about each type."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use adjectives to describe the coffee."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify different coffee drinks."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a description of different coffee drinks."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss coffee drinks with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le06ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le06ob10re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"tex